{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組選舉結果陸續公布，商界（第三）17名當選人分別是應越、郭端祥、褚卓倫、姚來文、朱立偉、廖偉倫、沈華、游偉光、辛聰金、周永順、趙爽、趙珺、林淑芬、連少冬、温雪飛、莊惠明、林紫瑾。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅詠暉\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:43:50.686226+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":104,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T14:06:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T16:20:08.124711+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:37:28.069772+00:00","content_hash":"b70dd9b2a42169ed304312d4ab0bd501c6e0a366d9902c670d3f32ecc47b13eb","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}